# AWS Configuration – My Cloud Support Lab

## 1. Project Overview

**Project:** My Cloud Support Lab – Deploying a Linux Web Server on Amazon EC2

This project demonstrates how to launch and configure an Amazon EC2 instance, install the Apache web server, and host a simple HTML/CSS website that can be accessed over the internet.

